%%{init: {'theme':'default'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Admin User
    participant App as Node.js App (PEP)
    participant Auth0 as Auth0 (Identity)
    participant Cerbos as Cerbos (PDP)
    participant Local as Local Storage
    participant AI as OpenAI (Mini + 4o)

    User->>App: Request "Analyze" Action
    App->>Auth0: Extract JWT Roles
    Note over App,Cerbos: Authorization Layer
    App->>Cerbos: checkPerm(Principal, "all_files", "analyze")
    Cerbos-->>App: EFFECT_ALLOW (Policy Validated)
    Note over App,AI: AI Workflow (Dual-Model RAG)
    App->>Local: Read source JSON files
    loop Pre-processing
        App->>AI: Send content to gpt-4o-mini
        AI-->>App: Return concise initial summary
    end
    App->>AI: Generate Embeddings (Text-Embedding-3)
    App->>App: Build In-Memory Vector Store (LangChain)
    App->>AI: RetrievalQAChain via gpt-4o
    AI-->>App: Return final synthesized intelligence
    App->>Local: Write summary_timestamp.json
    App-->>User: Success (Dashboard Updated)
